<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Password Reset</title>
</head>

<body>

<h2>Hello ${name}!</h2>

<p>
    We received a password reset request.
</p>

<p>
    <a href="${resetLink}">
        Reset Password
    </a>
</p>

<p>
    If this wasn't you, ignore this email.
</p>

</body>
</html>